{"5119690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Money Makes Money: Historical Market Simulator", "steam_appid": 5119690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“If only I had bought Bitcoin back then...”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I knew NVIDIA was going somewhere. Why didn’t I invest?”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has thought about it at least once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if you could actually go back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2030. After losing your job to AI, you struggle to get through each day with little hope for the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then a home AI robot named <strong>Honey Dragon (H.D.) </strong>appears and offers you a second chance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to 2010—and </strong>seize the investment opportunity of a lifetime<strong>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade and Live Through History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money Makes Money: Historical Market Simulator</strong> takes you through the markets of 2010–2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for companies, study charts, read historical news, and trade stocks and cryptocurrencies before advancing to the next month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in companies before they reshape the world. Enter the cryptocurrency market before it becomes mainstream. Prepare for the crashes, recoveries, and opportunities that history has already revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You already know what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure where to start? Don’t worry—H.D. will be there to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Protect, and Spend Your Fortune</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing the future does not make every decision easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living costs continue to accumulate, unexpected events demand money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also spend your fortune on  minigames, including including an anime-style gacha game and an idle  RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You already know the history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were given a second chance to build a fortune.</strong><br><strong>What that chance will cost you is another question.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money makes money. But not for everyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“If only I had bought Bitcoin back then...”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I knew NVIDIA was going somewhere. Why didn’t I invest?”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has thought about it at least once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if you could actually go back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2030. After losing your job to AI, you struggle to get through each day with little hope for the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then a home AI robot named <strong>Honey Dragon (H.D.) </strong>appears and offers you a second chance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to 2010—and </strong>seize the investment opportunity of a lifetime<strong>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade and Live Through History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money Makes Money: Historical Market Simulator</strong> takes you through the markets of 2010–2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for companies, study charts, read historical news, and trade stocks and cryptocurrencies before advancing to the next month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in companies before they reshape the world. Enter the cryptocurrency market before it becomes mainstream. Prepare for the crashes, recoveries, and opportunities that history has already revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You already know what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure where to start? Don’t worry—H.D. will be there to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Protect, and Spend Your Fortune</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing the future does not make every decision easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living costs continue to accumulate, unexpected events demand money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also spend your fortune on  minigames, including including an anime-style gacha game and an idle  RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You already know the history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were given a second chance to build a fortune.</strong><br><strong>What that chance will cost you is another question.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money makes money. But not for everyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Travel through 2010–2025 and trade historical stocks and cryptocurrencies with the benefit of hindsight. Build a fortune, survive unexpected costs, and uncover the story behind it all.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5119690/1d9d5357aa05940114fc887f4a7a9647010024fb/header.jpg?t=1787542682", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5119690/42ea4f7fb048b7e08b87cb43bb5a01357f2bb323/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787542682", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.